    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66385" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσ-ευθύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ύ</span>, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>between the even ones</i>: <i><span class="en">
				Pythag.
			</span></i> name for the number <i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>, as <i>half-way between</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>
			<i>and</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>, the first and last of the even (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθεῖς</span>) numbers in the denary scale, <i><span class="en">
				Clem.Al.
				<u>Strom.</u>
				6.139.2
			</span></i>.</div>
